@startuml
actor 管理员 as Admin
participant 前端 as Frontend
participant AdminActivityController as Controller
participant ActivityService as ActivitySvc
participant UserService as UserSvc
participant NotificationService as NotifSvc
database SQLite as DB

Admin -> Frontend: 查看待审核列表
Frontend -> Controller: GET /admin/activities/pending
Controller -> ActivitySvc: page(status=1)
ActivitySvc -> DB: SELECT status=1
DB --> ActivitySvc: 活动列表
ActivitySvc --> Controller: Page<Activity>
Controller --> Frontend: 返回数据
Frontend --> Admin: 显示列表

Admin -> Frontend: 点击通过
Frontend -> Controller: POST /admin/activities/approve/{id}
Controller -> ActivitySvc: getById()
ActivitySvc -> DB: 查询活动
DB --> ActivitySvc: 活动数据
ActivitySvc --> Controller: Activity
Controller -> UserSvc: getByUsername() 获取管理员
UserSvc -> DB: 查询用户
DB --> UserSvc: 管理员数据
UserSvc --> Controller: User
Controller -> ActivitySvc: updateById() 状态设为2
ActivitySvc -> DB: UPDATE status=2
DB --> ActivitySvc: 成功
Controller -> NotifSvc: sendAuditResult() 通知组织者
NotifSvc -> DB: INSERT notification
Controller --> Frontend: 审核通过
Frontend --> Admin: 显示成功
@enduml